  "instructions": [
    "Bring 4 cups of water to a boil in a large pot.",
    "Gradually whisk in the polenta and reduce heat to medium.",
    "Cook the polenta for 20 minutes, stirring frequently, until it thickens.",
    "In a large skillet, heat the olive oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the diced pancetta and cook until crispy, then set aside.",
    "Add the chopped mixed peel to the skillet and cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Add the white wine, mustard, salt, and black pepper to the skillet and stir to combine.",
    "Simmer the sauce for 5 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Stir the grated parmesan cheese into the polenta.",
    "To serve, place the cooked polenta on a slate tile vessel, top with the sauce, and garnish with chopped parsley."
